        "original_id": "ba4db282-6869-51c9-9e52-3269c204fbb1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Grapico, Izze\n- Companies: Buffalo Rock\n- Places: Southeastern United States\n- Topics: soft drinks, fruit soda, bottling\n\nFacts:\n- Buffalo Rock produced Grapico in 1981 as a grape-flavored soft drink under its own brand name, while also bottling Pepsi products and producing a ginger ale under its own brand name.\n- Grapico is a caffeine-free, artificially flavored, purple carbonated soft drink with a grape taste that is sold in the Southeastern United States.\n- Izze is an all-natural fruit soda with no preservatives added.",
